https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-idf/en/v5.0.4/esp32c3/get-started/linux-macos-setup.html

sudo apt-get install git wget flex bison gperf python3 python3-pip python3-venv cmake ninja-build ccache libffi-dev libssl-dev dfu-util libusb-1.0-0

Install esp-idf:
mkdir -p ~/esp
cd ~/esp
git clone -b v6.0.2 --recursive https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf.git
cd esp-idf
./install.sh esp32c3
. $HOME/esp/esp-idf/export.sh

In the project path:
. $HOME/esp/esp-idf/export.sh
idf.py set-target esp32c3
idf.py menuconfig (enable bluetooth and 4.2 compatibility)
idf.py build
idf.py flash

idf.py fullclean to clean the build artifacts
port permissions:
sudo usermod -a -G dialout $USER
somehow did not work
newgrp dialout did work
the device identifies as /dev/ttyACM0
